 │ IP: 192.168.1.10              │
 │ DNS: 192.168.1.10             │
 │ AD DS + DNS (+ DHCP optional) │
 └───────────────────────────────┘
        │
 ┌───────────────────────────────┐
 │ Windows 10/11 Client          │
 │ Joined to company.local       │
 │ Receives IP from DHCP         │
 └───────────────────────────────┘
Phase 15: Verify Domain Functionality
To check it I need to test the following:
Log in with a domain user account.
Create additional users and groups in Active Directory.
Confirm DNS name resolution.
Verify the client appears in Active Directory Users and Computers.
Test Group Policy by creating a simple policy (e.g., desktop wallpaper or password policy).
